{
  "$comment": "Curated type library. source google = Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License: free for web and for bundling in apps). source adobe = Adobe Fonts (needs a Creative Cloud plan; web through an Adobe Fonts project only, not for bundling in an app). characters: the products a family suits. roles: ui (interface text), display (headlines), numeric (figures in tables and stats), mono (code, IDs), reading (long text). tabular: tabular figures available (font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums). tracking: extra letter-spacing in em added to the scale's value for display sizes, for families that are set loose or tight by design.",
  "characters": {
    "calm": "Quiet, steady, careful: finance, health, productivity, tools people open every day.",
    "precise": "Exact and dense: analytics, developer tools, B2B dashboards.",
    "friendly": "Open and approachable: consumer apps, education, community.",
    "warm": "Human and inviting: food, travel, local business, wellness.",
    "bold": "Confident and loud: sports, launches, media, campaigns.",
    "editorial": "Reading first: publishing, blogs, research, long-form content.",
    "luxurious": "Restrained and refined: fashion, hospitality, premium goods.",
    "playful": "Light and expressive: games, kids, creative tools, social.",
    "technical": "Engineered and literal: infrastructure, security, APIs, CLIs.",
    "trustworthy": "Plain and dependable: banking, insurance, government, legal."
  },
